---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/urls";
import site from "../data/site.json";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="The background, interests, and approach behind the work.">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A little context</p><h1>Behind the analysis.</h1><p class="lede">An electrical engineer turned software and analytics engineer, interested in systems that turn complicated data into useful decisions.</p></header>
    <div class="detail-grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="section-label">01 / Background</p><h2>Hi, I'm {site.name}.</h2><p>I studied electrical engineering and technological entrepreneurship at McGill, then moved from technical analysis into software engineering at Multidev Technologies. There I worked across shipping platforms, data pipelines, cloud delivery, integrations, database performance, and production observability.</p><p>I'm now completing an M.S. in Analytics at USC, building the statistical and data-engineering depth to apply that systems experience to sports, decision support, and other data-intensive domains.</p>
        <p class="section-label">02 / Approach</p><h2>How I approach a question.</h2><p>I like to trace a problem from its operational context through the underlying data and into something a person can actually use. That usually means clarifying the decision first, making the pipeline reliable, choosing a method that fits the evidence, and documenting the assumptions instead of hiding them.</p><p>The <a href={withBase("/projects/sport-analytics-data-warehouse/")}>USC Football warehouse</a> and <a href={withBase("/projects/electromagnetic-tweezer-apparatus/")}>electromagnetic tweezer project</a> show that approach in two very different settings.</p>
        <p class="section-label">03 / Outside the spreadsheet</p><h2>A little more about me.</h2><p>My co-curricular history spans sports writing, student publications, technical volunteering, student leadership, fabric arts, climbing, and sports-business communities. I speak English and Hindi natively and French fluently.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="sidebar-note" aria-label="At a glance"><p class="section-label">At a glance</p><dl><dt>Focus</dt><dd>{site.role}</dd><dt>Based in</dt><dd>{site.location}</dd><dt>Next chapter</dt><dd>{site.availability}</dd></dl><a class="text-link" href={withBase("/resume/")}>View my résumé <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={withBase("/credentials/")}>Education & credentials <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
